<title>USA: Temple-Inland denies wrongful termination.</title>
<headline>Temple-Inland denies wrongful termination.</headline>
<dateline>DIBOLL, Texas 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Temple-Inland Inc denied on Monday allegations made by a former employee in a wrongful termination lawsuit.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement it was confident that the court would find that the allegations made by the former assistant tax manager had no merit.</p>
<p>It declined to comment further until the suit's resolution.</p>
<p>Temple-Inland of Diboll, Texas, makes paper, corrugated packaging and building products, with financial services operations in mortgage and consumer banking.</p>
</text>
